/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:39:- Count the 4-connected background regions fully enclosed by those reconstructed walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:40:- The color with no enclosed region is the noise/pad color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:41:- Sort drawing colors by enclosed-region count; equal counts are ordered by which reconstructed frame covers the other.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:42:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:43:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:44:- The scattered color is not an object; it only pads the histogram, while each true object's room count is stable after rectilinear wall reconstruction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:45:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:46:</reference_puzzle>
