/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:241:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:242:Sort scattered 4×4 squares into two columns by type: frames left, solids right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:243:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:244:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:245:- bg = most common color. Multiple 4×4 objects on bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:246:- Frames: colored 1px border, bg-filled 2×2 interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:247:- Solids: entirely filled with one non-bg color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:248:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:249:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:250:- Classify each 4×4 object as frame or solid by its interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:251:- Sort each group top-to-bottom by input row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:252:- Stack frames in left column (cols 0–3), solids in right (cols 4–7).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:253:- Output is 8 wide; height = 4 × max(#frames, #solids), bg-padded.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:254:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:255:Key insight: Frame vs solid is determined solely by whether the 2×2 interior matches bg.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:256:</description>
