/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:331:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:332:Reveal the rectangular patch hidden by the solid marker using the grid's reflection symmetries.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:333:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:334:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:335:- A square colored pattern with one solid rectangular marker color occluding a patch.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:336:- The visible pattern has horizontal and vertical reflection symmetry on a large lower/right strip.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:337:- The top and left outer strips also expose transpose counterparts for cells not recoverable by those reflections.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:338:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:339:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:340:- Find the unique color whose full extent is a solid rectangle; this rectangle is the output region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:341:- Infer the reflected strip start as the smallest row/column offset whose lower/right strips are mirror-consistent, ignoring marker pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:342:- For each marker pixel, copy the unique non-marker value in its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; if that orbit is entirely hidden in the outer strip, use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:343:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:344:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:345:The marker is not part of the pattern; it covers a missing rectangle whose cells are still determined by the visible mirror or transpose copies elsewhere in the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:346:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:347:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:348:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:349:<reference_puzzle index="19" source="eval" puzzle_id="da515329" lines="11-24">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:350:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:351:Grow four clockwise spiral wall paths from the tips of a teal cross.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:352:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:353:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:354:- bg = 0 (black). A single teal (8) cross centered in the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:355:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:356:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:357:- Each arm tip launches a "turtle" heading 90° right of its outward direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:358:- Movement priority: turn right > go straight > turn left (left only if not on border).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:359:- Normal step = 2 cells; step right after a turn = 1 cell.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:360:- Each new cell must have a 1-cell orthogonal gap from all existing walls except the predecessor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:361:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:362:Key insight: The right-turn preference plus alternating 2/1 step lengths creates self-avoiding spirals that tile the grid with uniform spacing.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:363:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:364:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:365:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:366:<reference_puzzle index="20" source="eval" puzzle_id="1ae2feb7" lines="30-45">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:367:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:368:Extend row bars periodically across the opposite side of a separator column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:369:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:370:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:371:- bg = background. A near-solid vertical separator divides the grid into two sides.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:372:- One side contains horizontal colored bars; the other side is blank target space.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:373:- Bars may be stacked by row and may sit at different distances from the separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:374:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:375:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:376:- Identify the separator as the column whose non-bg cells are one color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:377:- Treat the denser side as the bar side and collect each contiguous row run.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:378:- Process bars from nearest to farthest from the separator; for each bar, paint its
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:379:  color every bar-length cells into the blank side without overwriting earlier paint.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:380:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:381:Key insight: Each bar's length is the period for its extension, and nearer bars claim target cells first.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:382:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:383:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:384:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:385:你的任务：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:386:以参考题为标杆，运用发散性思维进行创新扩展。请发挥创造力，构思全新且巧妙的推理谜题。用中文创造全新的 ARC 谜题描述。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:387:创新方式包括但不限于：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:388:**机制重组**：将多道参考题各自的核心机制提取出来，组合成一个新的多步管道，用到新的场景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:389:**机制变异**：取几道参考题的核心机制，以机制为基础进行创新并与其他多种机制进行创新重组，使解题路径发生质变而非量变。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:390:**逆向构造**：取一道参考题的输出模式，思考"什么样的输入规则能产生类似的输出结构但需要完全不同的推理过程"。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:391:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:392:严格使用下面的 XML 风格格式输出：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:393:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:394:<new_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:395:- `description`：一句话概述题目的变换目标。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:396:- `Input structure`：输入网格中有哪些对象、背景、标记、边界或组件。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:397:- `Rule`：从输入到输出的确定性变换规则。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:398:- `Key insight`：解题所需的核心洞见。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:399:</new_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:400:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:401:请一次性生成 5 个 `<new_puzzle>`，若有较多合适的创新，也可以生成更多，不设上限，但不要输出额外解释。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:402:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:403:注意事项：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:404:1. 任务不应依赖大量先验知识或复杂计算，而应依赖对模式、结构与空间关系的直觉推理。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:405:2. 关于"计算"的边界：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:406:   - **允许使用**（这些都是人类能心算的视觉量）：数像素 / 孔洞 / 对象 / 邻居（≤10 量级）、比大小、按某个可见属性排序、奇偶判断、取最大 / 最小、用一个计数值作为另一个等量几何量（如 N 个像素 → 长度 N 的射线、面积 N → 边长 N）、判断接触 / 相邻 / 包含、粗略中心位置（簇的视觉中点）、"距离"作为"几步"而不是公式等人类能够直观感受计算的内容。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:407:   - **禁止使用**（这些是算法量而非视觉量，会迫使解题者依赖公式而非视觉直觉）：曼哈顿 / 欧氏 / Chebyshev 距离作为精确查表键、凸包面积、二进制位编码 / 位运算、模运算（取模） / 余数、拓扑距离（BFS / 最短路 / 跳数）、精确几何质心坐标、凸角 / 凹角计数等复杂且不易被看出来的计算都是禁止使用的。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/prompt.md:408:3. 问题必须能从少量示例中推断出来（通常为 3 对训练样例 + 1 个测试样例）。设计时从人类解题者的视觉角度思考：规则涉及的所有关键要素（对象、关系、属性）必须在网格上肉眼可见，不应依赖人眼无法直接观察到的隐含信息（例如颜色id和颜色亮度是禁止使用的）或需要推算的隐藏属性。规则背后的逻辑本身可以有一定挑战性，但解题所需的所有线索必须能从网格中直接获取。
