/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:92:Convert a rough nested line drawing into a clean canonical frame-and-dot diagram.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:93:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:94:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:95:- The grid has one background color and one foreground color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:96:- Foreground 4-connected objects are rough closed frames or small filled blobs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:97:- Frames may contain other frames/blobs; blobs outside a frame remain outside it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:98:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:99:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:100:- Detect the containment tree of foreground objects using holes of each frame object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:101:- Replace every blob with one foreground pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:102:- Replace every frame with a rectangular border padded two cells around its direct children.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:103:- Place siblings by their original row/column overlap and order, with one empty cell between canonical objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:104:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:105:Key insight: The exact wobbly geometry is irrelevant; only enclosure plus relative sibling positions define the output.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:106:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:107:<annotation>
