/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:180:Turn a 4-cell-wide strip of 2x2 blocks into four nested corner-fill patterns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:181:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:182:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:183:The input is an even-sized rectangle whose shorter dimension is four pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:184:It can be partitioned exactly into 2x2 blocks, giving one block for each layer
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:185:of the output quadrants.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:186:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:187:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:188:Read the 2x2 blocks in reverse row-major order: bottom-right block first,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:189:moving left, then moving upward. For each block, send its top-left,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:190:top-right, bottom-left, and bottom-right pixels to the layer sequences of the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:191:upper-left, upper-right, lower-left, and lower-right output quadrants.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:192:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:193:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:194:Each input 2x2 block supplies the four colors for one concentric layer, and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:195:the layer order is the block order from bottom-right back to top-left.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:196:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:197:<annotation>
