/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:261:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:262:Expand each sparse color object into a filled rectangular region using its legend-paired fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:263:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:264:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:265:A background-color grid has a two-column legend in columns 0 and 1, starting at row 0: each row gives
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:266:a source color in the left column and that source color's fill color in the right column.  Outside the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:267:legend, the foreground pixels are sparse dot objects whose colors are exactly the legend source colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:268:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:269:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:270:Clear the legend.  For each source color, take the bbox of all of its non-legend dots, expand that bbox
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:271:by one pixel in every direction, and fill background cells inside the expanded rectangle with the paired
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:272:legend fill color while preserving every original non-legend dot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:273:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:274:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:275:The legend order is also the layer order: earlier legend rows are in front, so fill rectangles are painted
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:276:from the last legend row back to the first and higher-priority fills overwrite lower-priority fills.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:277:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:278:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:279:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:280:  "type": "move_in_order",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:281:  "src": "sparse same-color dot objects and the upper-left source/fill legend",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:282:  "dst": "paint each object's bbox expanded by one pixel",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:283:  "transform": "clear the legend; fill pixels that are not original dots inside each expanded bbox with the paired fill color and preserve the original dots",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:284:  "multi_step": "process legend rows bottom-to-top so earlier rows have priority where expanded bboxes overlap",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:285:  "symbol_instructions": "upper-left source/fill legend maps each dot color to its expanded-bbox fill color"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:286:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:287:</annotation>
