/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:303:Summarize the enclosed table slots by the single object color inside each slot, using the slot background color for empty slots.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:304:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:305:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:306:- The most common color forms the outer background and all enclosed slot
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:307:  backgrounds.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:308:- The enclosed background components form a complete rectangular array of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:309:  slots, ordered by their positions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:310:- Each slot contains either no other color or exactly one object color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:311:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:312:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:313:- Find all 4-connected components of the most common color that do not touch
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:314:  the input edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:315:- Sort their bounding boxes into row and column order to define the output
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:316:  table.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:317:- For each slot, output its unique non-background color if present; otherwise
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:318:  output the background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:319:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:320:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:321:- The large grid is an expanded table: the enclosed background components are
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:322:  the cells, and any colored object drawn inside a cell is that cell's summary
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:323:  value.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:324:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:325:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:326:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:327:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:328:  "src": "enclosed 4-connected background-color slot components arranged as a rectangular table, each containing zero or one non-background object color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:329:  "transform": "collapse each slot to one output pixel in row/column order: use the contained object color if present, otherwise use the background color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:330:  "grid_shape": "number of slot rows x number of slot columns"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:331:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/3.md:332:</annotation>
