/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:100:Fit a grey bar into a grey frame by aligning projections with colored columns, then stack colors above.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:101:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:102:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:103:- bg, a grey structural color forming two components: a large rectangular frame (slot) and a smaller bar with upward projections.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:104:- Colored pixels inside the slot mark target columns.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:105:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:106:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:107:- Move the bar upward into the slot so its bottom edge sits one cell above the slot's interior bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:108:- Shift it horizontally so the bar's upward projections align column-wise with the colored pixels in the slot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:109:- Stack the colored pixels immediately above the bar projections in each column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:110:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:111:Key insight: The bar's projections act as keys that must align with the colored-column "locks" in the slot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:112:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:113:<annotation>
