/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:156:Convert each colored partitioned frame into a horizontal bar whose length is its number of enclosed regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:157:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:158:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:159:- Black background with several axis-aligned colored line drawings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:160:- The line drawings are damaged by scattered pixels of one non-background noise color and by overlaps with other drawings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:161:- Each real drawing is a rectangular partitioned frame enclosing one or more background regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:162:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:163:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:164:- For each non-background color, reconstruct its horizontal and vertical wall segments from dense row/column evidence.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:165:- Count the 4-connected background regions fully enclosed by those reconstructed walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:166:- The color with no enclosed region is the noise/pad color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:167:- Sort drawing colors by enclosed-region count; equal counts are ordered by which reconstructed frame covers the other.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:168:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:169:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:170:- The scattered color is not an object; it only pads the histogram, while each true object's room count is stable after rectilinear wall reconstruction.
