/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:330:Connect framed squares via colored bridges following a control-pixel sequence.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:331:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:332:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:333:- bg = background. Border color forms equal-sized framed squares with unique inner fill colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:334:- Control row below squares: colored pixels read left-to-right encode visitation order.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:335:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:336:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:337:- Start at the square matching first control color c0.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:338:- For each consecutive pair (ci, ci+1), find the ci+1-colored square aligned in the same row or column band, preferring nearest.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:339:- Draw a bridge colored ci between the pair, spanning the gap with inner-square thickness.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:340:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:341:Key insight: Row/column-band alignment plus proximity resolves ambiguity when inner colors repeat.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:342:</description>
