/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:370:Summarize the enclosed table slots by the single object color inside each slot, using the slot background color for empty slots.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:371:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:372:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:373:- The most common color forms the outer background and all enclosed slot
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:374:  backgrounds.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:375:- The enclosed background components form a complete rectangular array of
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:376:  slots, ordered by their positions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:377:- Each slot contains either no other color or exactly one object color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:378:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:379:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:380:- Find all 4-connected components of the most common color that do not touch
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:381:  the input edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:382:- Sort their bounding boxes into row and column order to define the output
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:383:  table.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:384:- For each slot, output its unique non-background color if present; otherwise
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:385:  output the background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:386:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:387:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:388:- The large grid is an expanded table: the enclosed background components are
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:389:  the cells, and any colored object drawn inside a cell is that cell's summary
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:390:  value.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:391:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:392:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:393:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:394:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:395:  "src": "enclosed 4-connected background-color slot components arranged as a rectangular table, each containing zero or one non-background object color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:396:  "transform": "collapse each slot to one output pixel in row/column order: use the contained object color if present, otherwise use the background color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:397:  "grid_shape": "number of slot rows x number of slot columns"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:398:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/6.md:399:</annotation>
