/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:55:- The mover square travels along the river toward the destination.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:56:- It can only pass through positions where the full NxN area is river.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:57:- If reachable, the mover replaces the destination; otherwise it stops at the farthest reachable point.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:58:- The mover's original position is filled with the river color.
