/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:236:- Recolor each path branch to the seed-region color it touches most.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/2.md:237:- Recolor the hub center pixel to the seed whose branches touch the hub most.
