/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:96:Slide a solid square through a winding channel to reach a same-sized target square.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:97:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:98:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:99:- bg (most common color). A river color forms a winding corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:100:- Two same-sized NxN solid squares on the river: mover and destination, each a distinct color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:101:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:102:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:103:- The mover square travels along the river toward the destination.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:104:- It can only pass through positions where the full NxN area is river.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:105:- If reachable, the mover replaces the destination; otherwise it stops at the farthest reachable point.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:106:- The mover's original position is filled with the river color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:107:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:108:Key insight: Chokepoints narrower than N pixels block the square, forcing it to stop short.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:109:</description>
