/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:134:Complete the framed area by expanding the unique upper template that contains the existing seed pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:135:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:136:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:137:- A teal background contains small colored template masks above a larger rectangular frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:138:- The frame encloses one fill color arranged as a partial block-scaled copy of one template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:139:- The frame interior dimensions are an integer square scale of the matching template bbox.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:140:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:141:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:142:- Crop to the rectangular frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:143:- Identify the unique upper template whose block-scaled mask covers every existing fill pixel inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:144:- Reset the frame interior to background and paint the whole scaled mask with the fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:145:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:146:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:147:The lower colored pixels are seed cells that reveal which upper template should be completed inside the frame.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:148:</description>
