/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:174:Predict the next panel in a framed sequence by continuing each scheduled colored interval.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:175:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:176:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:177:- The grid is made from three or more equal panels in one row or one column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:178:- The final input panel is the static target template; every earlier panel differs from it only by dynamic colors absent from the template.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:179:- Each dynamic color appears in a regular temporal schedule across the earlier panels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:180:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:181:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:182:- Keep the final template panel as the output canvas.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:183:- For every dynamic color whose schedule reaches the next panel, compare its last two appearances.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:184:- Extrapolate each one-dimensional interval along the color's changing row or column axis and paint that predicted mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:185:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:186:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:187:- The task is not asking for the last visible panel, but for the next frame after the blank/template slot.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:188:</description>
