/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:265:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:266:- Full same-color separator rows and columns partition the grid into equal rectangular tiles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:267:- One tile contains the only non-background, non-separator colored sprite.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:268:- Target tiles are otherwise background-colored but contain at least one internal pixel of the separator color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:269:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:270:Rule
