/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:272:- Replace each marked target tile with an exact copy of the source tile.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:273:- Unmarked background-only tiles remain unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:274:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:275:Key insight
