/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:302:Reflect the solid rectangular source objects across the full separator line and color the gap with the separator color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:303:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:304:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:305:- A dominant background contains one full-width or full-height one-pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:306:  separator line in a non-background color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:307:- One other foreground color forms solid rectangular objects, all strictly on the same side of that separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:308:- Remaining non-background pixels are scattered distractors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:309:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:310:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:311:- Keep the input grid shape and unchanged pixels outside each affected corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:312:- Mirror each source object across the separator line.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:313:- For every source object, recolor the rectangular strip between the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:314:  original object and its reflection to the separator color, then paint the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:315:  reflected object in the source color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:316:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:317:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:318:- The full straight line is a mirror axis; the real objects are identified
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:319:  structurally as the only solid rectangles confined to one side, while
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:320:  scattered pixels are noise that may be overwritten inside the corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:321:</description>
