/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:345:Convert each colored partitioned frame into a horizontal bar whose length is its number of enclosed regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:346:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:347:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:348:- Black background with several axis-aligned colored line drawings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:349:- The line drawings are damaged by scattered pixels of one non-background noise color and by overlaps with other drawings.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:350:- Each real drawing is a rectangular partitioned frame enclosing one or more background regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:351:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:352:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:353:- For each non-background color, reconstruct its horizontal and vertical wall segments from dense row/column evidence.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:354:- Count the 4-connected background regions fully enclosed by those reconstructed walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:355:- The color with no enclosed region is the noise/pad color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:356:- Sort drawing colors by enclosed-region count; equal counts are ordered by which reconstructed frame covers the other.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:357:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:358:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:359:- The scattered color is not an object; it only pads the histogram, while each true object's room count is stable after rectilinear wall reconstruction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/1.md:360:</description>
