/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:121:- bg = most common color. Non-bg rectangular pieces scattered on the grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:122:- 3-pixel L-marker (2x2 minus one cell) tags the corner; the gap is the corner cell.
