/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:124:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:125:- rect_col = most common color across all piece pixels; all outer rectangle edges must be rect_col.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:126:- Translate pieces (no rotation) to tile the rectangle; touching edges must match, with rect_col as wildcard.
