/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:155:Push every colored object touching maroon markers straight outward until it reaches the grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:156:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:157:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:158:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:159:- Maroon pixels are fixed markers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:160:- Every other foreground 4-connected object touches the marker pixels on exactly one cardinal side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:161:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:162:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:163:- Clear each non-background, non-maroon object from its original position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:164:- Translate it in the direction away from its maroon contact until the object reaches the grid boundary.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:165:- Keep the maroon marker pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:166:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:167:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:168:- The maroon contact side is a launcher: it determines a unique outward ray for the whole object, and the edge of the grid determines the translation distance.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:169:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:170:<annotation>
