/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:195:Remove each fracture marker line and push the surrounding object pixels one cell away from it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:196:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:197:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:198:- A background grid with 8-connected foreground objects made from a body color and a rarer marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:199:- Each object has a non-square bbox; the marker pixels form one complete fracture line across the shorter bbox axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:200:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:201:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:202:- Erase all marker pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:203:- For a wide object, each row has one marker; body pixels left of it shift one cell left and body pixels right of it shift one cell right.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:204:- For a tall object, each column has one marker; body pixels above it shift one cell up and body pixels below it shift one cell down.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:205:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:206:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:207:- The marker line is a crack through the object, so the two sides separate by one pixel perpendicular to the crack.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:208:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:209:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:210:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:211:  "type": "transform_in_place",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:212:  "src": "8-connected body-color objects on the background, each crossed by a rarer marker-color fracture line",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:213:  "transform": "erase the marker pixels; in each wide object shift body pixels one cell left/right away from the row marker, and in each tall object shift body pixels one cell up/down away from the column marker"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:214:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:215:</annotation>
