/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:231:Slide multi-color sprites to align their marker pixels with matching isolated border anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:232:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:233:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:234:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:235:- Multi-color sprites in the interior; each has a minority-color "marker" pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:236:- Isolated border pixels (non-bg with all 4-neighbors bg) act as anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:237:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:238:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:239:- Match each sprite to the border anchor sharing its marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:240:- Top/bottom-edge anchor (non-corner): slide sprite horizontally so marker column = anchor column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:241:- Left/right-edge anchor (or corner): slide sprite vertically so marker row = anchor row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:242:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:243:Key insight: The anchor's edge position determines the slide axis — top/bottom means horizontal, left/right (or corner) means vertical.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:244:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:245:<annotation>
