/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:269:Drop the columns of the top marker downward, stopping blue-ended columns on grey obstacles and letting maroon-ended columns pass to the bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:270:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:271:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:272:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:273:- The most numerous non-background color forms stationary grey obstacle pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:274:- The other two colors form a single 3x3 top-edge marker whose top two rows
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:275:  are maroon and whose bottom row contains maroon or blue control pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:276:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:277:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:278:- Erase the top marker.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:279:- Treat each marker column as a vertical drop retaining its three colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:280:- A column whose bottom control pixel is blue stops immediately above the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:281:  first grey pixel below that column, or bottom-aligns if none exists.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:282:- Contiguous maroon-ended columns pass through obstacles and bottom-align;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:283:  if such a run has a clear down-right slide from a grey ledge, shift the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:284:  run one column right before bottom-aligning.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:285:- When a maroon-ended drop lands through a grey bar on the bottom edge, clear
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:286:  the rest of the marker-width gap in that bottom bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:287:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:288:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/7.md:289:- The bottom row of the top marker is a control strip: blue cells mean
