/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:50:Convert a rough nested line drawing into a clean canonical frame-and-dot diagram.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:51:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:52:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:53:- The grid has one background color and one foreground color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:54:- Foreground 4-connected objects are rough closed frames or small filled blobs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:55:- Frames may contain other frames/blobs; blobs outside a frame remain outside it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:56:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:57:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:58:- Detect the containment tree of foreground objects using holes of each frame object.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:59:- Replace every blob with one foreground pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:60:- Replace every frame with a rectangular border padded two cells around its direct children.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:61:- Place siblings by their original row/column overlap and order, with one empty cell between canonical objects.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:62:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:63:Key insight: The exact wobbly geometry is irrelevant; only enclosure plus relative sibling positions define the output.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:64:</description>
