/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:89:Slide multi-color sprites to align their marker pixels with matching isolated border anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:90:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:91:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:92:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:93:- Multi-color sprites in the interior; each has a minority-color "marker" pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:94:- Isolated border pixels (non-bg with all 4-neighbors bg) act as anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:95:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:96:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:97:- Match each sprite to the border anchor sharing its marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:98:- Top/bottom-edge anchor (non-corner): slide sprite horizontally so marker column = anchor column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:99:- Left/right-edge anchor (or corner): slide sprite vertically so marker row = anchor row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:100:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:101:Key insight: The anchor's edge position determines the slide axis — top/bottom means horizontal, left/right (or corner) means vertical.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:102:</description>
