/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:178:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:179:- A periodic wallpaper background is overlaid by foreground colors that each form a rectangular frame or solid rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:180:- The largest foreground rectangle is the output frame; smaller foreground rectangles are the objects to nest inside it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:181:- A frame may be partially hidden by a smaller rectangle, but its visible pixels still determine its bbox.
