/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:215:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:216:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:217:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:218:- bg = most common color; yellow pixels sit inside enclosed regions bounded by colored walls.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:219:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:220:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:221:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:222:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:223:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:224:- All yellow pixels in that region slide in that direction, stacking against the far wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:225:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:226:Key insight: Legend fill color links to region border color; the center→indicator offset encodes the movement vector.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:227:</description>
