/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:264:Extract the single plain rectangle and redraw it with the aligned rectangles' border-relative marker pattern.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:265:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:266:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:267:- The boundary color is the background/separator.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:268:- Foreground objects are dense rectangular regions; exactly one rectangle has only its base color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:269:- Other rectangles contain their base color plus marker pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:270:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:271:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:272:- Crop the only plain rectangle; this crop is the output canvas.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:273:- Use marked rectangles whose row span overlaps the plain rectangle's row span.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:274:- Transfer their marker pixels by preserving each marker run's distance from the nearest rectangle edges.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:275:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:276:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:277:- The marked rectangles are examples of an edge-relative pattern, so the missing plain rectangle receives the same pattern resized to its own dimensions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:278:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:279:<annotation>
