/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:304:Expand the top-left seed mask into a recursive colored pattern and tile it across the full grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:305:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:306:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:307:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:308:- All foreground lies in a top-left rectangle whose last row and last column are a solid secondary color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:309:- Removing that secondary-color row and column leaves a seed region containing background plus one primary color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:310:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:311:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:312:- Use the primary-color pixels in the seed as a binary mask.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:313:- Replace each primary seed cell with a copy of the seed mask in the primary color, and each background seed cell
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:314:  with a copy of the seed mask in the secondary color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:315:- Repeat and crop that expanded tile to the original grid shape.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:316:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:317:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:318:The solid L-shaped secondary-color border is a legend, not output content; it supplies the color used when the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:319:seed's background cells are expanded.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:320:</description>
