/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:343:Fill the region enclosed by a wall sprite and radiate color outward through its opening.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:344:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:345:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:346:- bg = most common color. Wall = most frequent non-bg color, forming a partial enclosure (e.g. U-shape).
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:347:- A fill-color pixel sits inside the enclosed area. Other non-bg pixels may act as obstacles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:348:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:349:- Flood-fill the enclosed area with the fill color, radiating outward through the wall's open end.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:350:- Obstacles cast "shadows" along the radiate direction, blocking fill behind them.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:351:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:352:Key insight: The wall endpoints define the opening direction; fill radiates outward through it, and obstacles block propagation along that same axis.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/4.md:353:</description>
