/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:146:Push every colored object touching maroon markers straight outward until it reaches the grid edge.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:147:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:148:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:149:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:150:- Maroon pixels are fixed markers.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:151:- Every other foreground 4-connected object touches the marker pixels on exactly one cardinal side.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:152:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:153:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:154:- Clear each non-background, non-maroon object from its original position.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:155:- Translate it in the direction away from its maroon contact until the object reaches the grid boundary.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:156:- Keep the maroon marker pixels unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:157:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:158:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:159:- The maroon contact side is a launcher: it determines a unique outward ray for the whole object, and the edge of the grid determines the translation distance.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:160:</description>
