/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:186:Slide a solid square through a winding channel to reach a same-sized target square.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:187:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:188:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:189:- bg (most common color). A river color forms a winding corridor.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:190:- Two same-sized NxN solid squares on the river: mover and destination, each a distinct color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:191:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:192:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:193:- The mover square travels along the river toward the destination.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:194:- It can only pass through positions where the full NxN area is river.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:195:- If reachable, the mover replaces the destination; otherwise it stops at the farthest reachable point.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:196:- The mover's original position is filled with the river color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:197:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:198:Key insight: Chokepoints narrower than N pixels block the square, forcing it to stop short.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:199:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:200:<annotation>
