/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:224:Slide multi-color sprites to align their marker pixels with matching isolated border anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:225:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:226:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:227:- bg = most common color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:228:- Multi-color sprites in the interior; each has a minority-color "marker" pixel.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:229:- Isolated border pixels (non-bg with all 4-neighbors bg) act as anchors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:230:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:231:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:232:- Match each sprite to the border anchor sharing its marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:233:- Top/bottom-edge anchor (non-corner): slide sprite horizontally so marker column = anchor column.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:234:- Left/right-edge anchor (or corner): slide sprite vertically so marker row = anchor row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:235:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:236:Key insight: The anchor's edge position determines the slide axis — top/bottom means horizontal, left/right (or corner) means vertical.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:237:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:238:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:239:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:240:  "type": "move_to_match",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:241:  "src": "multi-color sprite s with a unique marker color (minority color inside s)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:242:  "dst": "align to isolated border pixel d (same marker color)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:243:  "match_cond": "s.marker.color == d.color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:244:  "transform": "translate s: if d on top/bottom edge → align col(s.marker) to col(d); else → align row(s.marker) to row(d); clip out-of-bounds pixels"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:245:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:246:</annotation>
