/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:262:Fill rectangles between diagonal marker pairs using a color legend.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:263:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:264:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:265:- bg grid with a vertical legend at the bottom-left: each row is a (marker_color, fill_color) pair.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:266:- Scattered L-shaped corner markers of each marker color define opposite corners of axis-aligned rectangles.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:267:- Some markers are solid 2×2 blocks instead of corner pairs.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:268:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:269:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:270:- Read legend bottom-to-top; for each entry find all pixels of that marker color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:271:- Determine which two bbox corners carry L-shaped anchors — the *other* diagonal defines the fill region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:272:- Fill the diamond (all shortest-path cells between those two corners) with the legend's fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:273:- Solid 2×2 marker blocks are simply recolored to the fill color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:274:- Later legend entries are protected from earlier fills.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:275:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:276:Key insight: The L-shaped anchors sit on the marker diagonal; the fill goes on the opposite diagonal of the bounding box.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:277:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:278:<annotation>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:279:{
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:280:  "summary": "Use a color legend at bottom-left to find diagonal marker pairs of matching color, then fill the rectangle between them with the adjacent legend color.",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:281:  "type": "move_to_match",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:282:  "src": "diagonal pixel pair s with same color forming opposite corners of a rectangle (upper corner pixel)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:283:  "dst": "diagonal pixel pair d with same color forming opposite corners of a rectangle (lower corner pixel)",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:284:  "match_cond": "s.color == d.color && s and d are diagonally opposite",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:285:  "path": "",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:286:  "trajectory": "",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:287:  "transform": "fill rectangle bounded by s and d with color from legend where legend.left == s.color gives fill_color = legend.right",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:288:  "symbol_instructions": "legend is vertical stack of color pairs at bottom-left, each pair (left-right only) has marker color on left and fill color on right",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:289:  "multi_step": "Step 1: identify legend as vertically stacked color pairs at bottom-left corner; Step 2: process legend entries from bottom to top; Step 3: for each legend entry (marker_color on left, fill_color on right), find all diagonal pairs of marker_color pixels; Step 4: fill rectangle between each diagonal pair with fill_color",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:290:  "concepts": [
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:291:    "color-legend",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:292:    "diagonal-markers",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:293:    "rectangle-fill",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:294:    "ordered-processing"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:295:  ],
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:296:  "notes": "sometimes as 2x2 squares which count as two diagonal triangles; processing order matters for overlapping regions"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:297:}
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:298:</annotation>
