/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:314:Drop the columns of the top marker downward, stopping blue-ended columns on grey obstacles and letting maroon-ended columns pass to the bottom.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:315:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:316:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:317:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:318:- The most numerous non-background color forms stationary grey obstacle pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:319:- The other two colors form a single 3x3 top-edge marker whose top two rows
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:320:  are maroon and whose bottom row contains maroon or blue control pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:321:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:322:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:323:- Erase the top marker.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:324:- Treat each marker column as a vertical drop retaining its three colors.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:325:- A column whose bottom control pixel is blue stops immediately above the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:326:  first grey pixel below that column, or bottom-aligns if none exists.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:327:- Contiguous maroon-ended columns pass through obstacles and bottom-align;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:328:  if such a run has a clear down-right slide from a grey ledge, shift the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:329:  run one column right before bottom-aligning.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:330:- When a maroon-ended drop lands through a grey bar on the bottom edge, clear
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:331:  the rest of the marker-width gap in that bottom bar.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:332:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed917989826/3/codegen_prompts/5.md:333:Key insight
